Z||000009||sjp777||06-03-2001||01:10 PM||||$5500 for an 88GT w/T-Tops.<P>Is it worth it? hmmm.<P>OF COURSE IT'S WORTH IT!<P>88GTs/Formulas are the cars everybody wants because of the suspension. T-top versions are very rare and add to the value.<P>I paid $5500 for my car and it didn't have T-tops, or a sunroof for that matter (that came later). It was totally worth it. I would have paid $6k if necessary. The car was in really good condition though, and I was looking for like 3 years before I found just the right one.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/890sm_4.jpg"> <BR>88GT 5sp, in desperate need of an LT1<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fiero88gt1/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fiero88gt1/</A>||||reg||1
